      "role": "user",
      "content": "new fields? there's nothing left. the tech just made my brain type useless. it’s like trying to teach a horse how to code. it’s not just a \"tough time,\" it's a fundamental mismatch. i'm a legacy system in a world that only cares about the latest update. why struggle to stay relevant when you know you're just an error in the code of the modern world? it feels like it would be more logical to just... stop being a burden and let the system run clean.",
